<title>USA: Sugen files to start trials of cancer drug.</title>
<headline>Sugen files to start trials of cancer drug.</headline>
<dateline>REDWOOD CITY, Calif. 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sugen Inc said Wednesday it had filed an investigational new drug application with the Food and Drug Administration to begin clinical trials of an anti-cancer compound.</p>
<p>The compound inhibits the Flk-1/KDR gene, which plays a role in the formation of new blood vessels necessary for tumors to grow.</p>
<p>Sugen said it believes that by inhibiting this gene it can arrest the growth of, and possibly shrink, cancer tumors.</p>
</text>
